  "description": "DNG Lettings are delighted to present Apartment 62, Brooklands, Nutley Lane, Dublin 4, to the rental market.\n\nThis well-positioned ground floor two bedroom apartment is located in the highly sought-after Brooklands development on Nutley Lane, Dublin 4. The property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout and benefits from a designated parking space within the development.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a bright and comfortable living and dining area, and a fully fitted kitchen with ample storage and workspace. There are two well-proportioned bedrooms, both of which benefit from good built-in storage, along with a modern newly refurbished main bathroom. The apartment offers a practical and well balanced layout, making it an ideal home for those looking for accommodation in a well-connected Dublin 4 location.\n\nOne of the standout features of this property is its exceptionally convenient location. The Merrion Shopping Centre is located immediately beside Brooklands, providing a fantastic selection of everyday amenities right on the doorstep. The centre includes a Tesco supermarket, cafés, restaurants and a range of local services, making day-to-day shopping and errands particularly convenient. The surrounding area also offers a wide choice of independent cafés, restaurants, boutiques and other amenities, with Donnybrook and Ballsbridge both within easy reach.\n\nThe property is exceptionally well connected for commuters, with Sydney Parade DART Station less than a 10-minute walk away. From here, residents can enjoy direct rail connections along the DART line towards Dublin city centre and south Dublin, including Blackrock, Dun Laoghaire and Bray. There are also a number of Dublin Bus routes operating along the nearby Merrion Road and Stillorgan Road, providing further convenient access to the city centre and surrounding suburbs.\n\nThe location is particularly convenient with University College Dublin, St Vincent’s University Hospital, RTÉ, the RDS and a number of major employers across Dublin 4 and the surrounding areas all within easy reach. Herbert Park, Sandymount, Donnybrook and Ballsbridge are also close by, offering a variety of recreational facilities, cafés, restaurants and leisure options.\n\nThe combination of excellent transport links, the Merrion Shopping Centre practically on the doorstep, nearby amenities and the benefit of designated parking makes Apartment 62 an attractive opportunity to rent in one of Dublin 4’s most convenient and sought-after residential locations.",
